## Featured case study: DeadCity

The DeadCity platform brings together player support, staff moderation, and server-related operations in one Discord-based system. It uses interactive forms, background tasks, database-backed state, and integration with external services.

- Multi-category support requests with status management and transcript exports.
- Moderation alerts based on server activity and configurable item rules.
- Application and identity-change approval workflows.
- Server status monitoring and operational audit trails.

